    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game based on <strong>skills, strategic </strong>and<strong> logical thinking</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend the essence of the universe from a horde of monsters using the power of the witch's magic and the accuracy of a brave archer. All in a psychedelic, original audiovisual setting inspired by <i>heroic fantasy</i> and more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Use 10 different weapons and 5 magical powers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Learn about your enemies and how to defeat them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Manage your stuff by using resources in a simple economic system. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Play with physics, reactions and dependencies or focus on getting the best score personal and global.., or both.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Find secrets in the game.</p>",
